`check` is green on an empty directory (`CHECK OK ... files=0 rows=0`). Declare `Verb.Looks` (files read) so it is FAILED with --allow-empty as the way out. A test.
STEP 5. Read `git diff -U0` from the start commit against HOW THIS CARD IS JUDGED, hunk by hunk; fix in the step that owns the hunk.
