  COMMIT: use-version-t: moved counts
  VERDICT: ok when the step's change is made and its package's tests pass; not-done or broken naming what remains
`moved`'s OK line and its note disagree, and neither is explained (a cold user). Make the counts agree and say in `help moved` what each counts. A test.
STEP 6. (hard) report json.
  PATHS: cmd/nova-version/*.go, internal/ci/testdata/toolanswers/cmd/nova-version.txt, internal/update/*.go
  COMMIT: use-version-t: report json
  VERDICT: ok when the step's change is made and its package's tests pass; not-done or broken naming what remains
`nova-version report --json` (and `send --json`) is refused while nova-update accepts it for what the help calls the same report. Accept it, returning the one Out. A test.
