  COMMIT: use-self-talk-t: binary green
  VERDICT: ok when the step's change is made and its package's tests pass; not-done or broken naming what remains
A binary file scans green (`head -c 2000 /dev/urandom > bin.dat; nova-self-talk bin.dat` gives `SELFTALK OK files=1 claims=0`). The tool's own rule is that a file it cannot read is not a clean one: refuse (or FAIL with a NOTE) a file that is not UTF-8 text. A test.
STEP 3. (hard) flags after files.
  PATHS: cmd/nova-self-talk/*.go, internal/ci/testdata/toolanswers/cmd/nova-self-talk.txt
