  PATHS: cmd/nova-self-talk/*.go, internal/ci/testdata/toolanswers/cmd/nova-self-talk.txt
  COMMIT: use-self-talk-t: example runs
  VERDICT: ok when the step's change is made and its package's tests pass; not-done or broken naming what remains
The banner's `example:` block cannot run as printed: it needs `nova-self-talk example ./pages` first, which sits above the block as prose. Put that line in the block, first. The onboarding test runs the block.
