  COMMIT: use-work-2-t: version key
  VERDICT: ok when the step's change is made and its package's tests pass; not-done or broken naming what remains
A wrong tree version is reported as a missing key (`(work-tree \"v2\")` gives `(work-tree) has no :source`). Say \"version v2 is not read; this build reads v1\". A test.
STEP 4. unknown help.
  PATHS: cmd/nova-work/*.go, internal/ci/testdata/toolanswers/cmd/nova-work.txt
