`acl apply`'s remedy names one missing user of four (`missing=coordinator,bench,ns-table,ns-friend ... run: nova-redis acl apply ... --password-env-for coordinator=<VARIABLE>`). The remedy carries every missing user's `--password-env-for <user>=<VARIABLE>`. A test.
