Two storage explanations contradict: internal/config/file.go says runtime tools read PostgreSQL, while cmd/nova-config/main.go says Redis is the view the fleet reads; main.go names a tool that does not exist (`nova-friend`). Say the actual flow in both: the file store is for local trials; the durable configuration lives in PostgreSQL; apply publishes the runtime view to Redis. Comments only. This card writes prose; the code's behaviour does not change.
