Typed lines in several dialects in nova-redis: `SPILL UNCONFIRMED`, a leading `LOADED|UNCHANGED|REPLACED`, `FAILED` records (a cold reader). One vocabulary: `<VERB> OK|FAILED|REFUSED` closing lines with the state as a fact (`state=unconfirmed`, `fn=loaded`), item lines for records; the unknown-outcome honesty stays (an unconfirmed spill is never OK). This renames printed tokens, so docs/TESTS.md's redis section follows in this card.
