Tests: TestCheckSaysBrokenWhenTheTableShowsUpButNoTurnWasAnswered (the measured Freddy case, verdict untrue then broken), TestCheckSaysDeafWhenDeliveriesSucceedAndNothingComesBack, TestCheckSaysOkForALiveFriend, TestCheckExitsOneOnAnyVerdictButOk, TestCheckJSONCarriesEveryFact. SPEC-FRIEND: a section \"Check\" (the facts, each verdict's rule). CLI.md and help: check.

