Usable cold by an AI from the tool's help alone: the verb's help names every flag, every output line and JSON field, every exit code, and one example that runs as written; docs/CLI.md carries the same text; the verbhelp tests pin it.
Tests: TestWatchWakesOnARealMessageAWakeLineOrAnEvent, TestWatchSavesTheCursorSoTheNextRunMissesNothing, TestWatchSkipsOwnPingPongAndKeepalive, TestWatchTimesOutAsNone (fake clock). SPEC-FRIEND: a section \"Watch\" (and that tmp/buswatch/watch.sh is retired by fg-adopt-friend-daemons). CLI.md and help: watch.

STEP 1. Enter the staged checkout JOB.md names, no clone; inspect git status and the actual full head. Work only on its own branch. Export GOCACHE=$JOB/cache/go-build GOFLAGS=-mod=readonly NOVA_TEST_NO_HOST=1 before any Go command. Scratch belongs under $JOB/scratch. Read AGENTS.md and the governing spec section; cite it from every function that implements a rule.
STEP 2. Write the red tests first, TestWatchWakesOnARealMessageAWakeLineOrAnEvent among them, each opening with t.Parallel(). Run them and keep the failing lines as evidence.
STEP 3. Make them pass by changing only the named PATHS and NEW files, minimally. Commit the draft on your own branch as soon as the tests are green, before any further probe; a later commit may refine it. A change any other file needs goes in the report as a proposed diff, never a commit.
STEP 4. Run the gate: nice -n 19 go test -p 2 -count=1 -timeout 600s ./cmd/nova-friend/ ./internal/friend/ ./internal/ci/, and keep the last line of each. Run gofmt -l on every changed Go file; it must print nothing.
STEP 5. Inspect the diff and commit only the named files on your own branch. Present-tense comments and docs; no names of people, machines or friends. Commit trailer Co-Authored-By: Claude <your model> <noreply@anthropic.com>. Finish exactly through JOB.md's protocol, no direct external publication; the STEP3 SHA in RESULT.md is the exact 40-hex git rev-parse HEAD. Report the actual gates, the red-to-green evidence, the diff stat and deletions, every helper added, and what was not done. PR body ends with 🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code). Normal independent review is required before landing; never merge yourself.")
