THE TASK. Adopt what the friends-general cards built, so the fleet's friend comms run on nova-tools alone, and retire the hand work of 2026-10-04. Today on the Studio: daemons installed by hand as com.nova.friend-{alex,emma,freddy,johnny,rowan,stella} (rowan's runs a binary on /Volumes/nova, which a launchd agent cannot use: the removable-volume wall; stella's runs a renamed binary, nova-friend-int, on the codex resume route); com.nova.loop.friend-ping-rowan pings every friend every 600 s from a shell loop; com.nova.loop.friend-beat-{alex,emma,johnny,stella,zhi} beat the sprint each second from shell loops; the coordinator's wake is a hand script (tmp/buswatch/watch.sh); Zhi has no daemon.
Do, in order, each step recorded with its command and result:
1. Build nova-friend and nova-bus from the integration tip into ~/.local/bin (never a path on /Volumes); `nova-friend version` and `nova-bus version` name the tip.
2. Reinstall every friend's daemon through `nova-friend install --as <f> --harness <h> --dir <d> --redis <bus store> --coordinator rowan` (with each harness's route as its open-chat card landed it; a harness whose card has not landed keeps its current route, said), Zhi's included; no --server: presence is the bus store's.
3. Install the coordinator's keepalive agent through `nova-friend install --role coordinator --as rowan` (the role fg-friend-keepalive-into-integration landed).
4. Retire the hand agents: `launchctl bootout gui/<uid>/<label>` for com.nova.loop.friend-ping-rowan and the five com.nova.loop.friend-beat-* agents, and move their plists into ~/Library/LaunchAgents/retired-2026-10-04/ (a mkdir and an mv of literal paths; nothing deleted). The coordinator's session switches from watch.sh to `nova-bus wait`.
5. Measure: `nova-friend peers` shows every friend up (or asleep) within 10 s; stop one friend's daemon and peers shows it down at 10 s and up again within 2 s of restart; with the sprint machine STOPPED for 60 s (`nova-sprint stop`, then `start`, the coordinator's own verbs), peers stays up for every live friend; one ping round to every friend with wait-pong 60 s each, the session pongs listed.
Announce the adoption on the bus to all friends with the one line each runs to see presence.

STEP 1. Set `JOB=~/rowan-working/jobs/<job>` from BRIEF.md and create only that directory; clone inside it when a step builds the tools: `mkdir -p \"$JOB\" && cd \"$JOB\" && git clone -q https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/nova-tools.git repo`, at the current tip of origin/rowan/integration-2026-10-04. Export GOCACHE=~/rowan-working/.cache/go-build GOFLAGS=-mod=readonly before any go command. Scratch under $JOB/scratch.

STEP 2. Do the task above in order, recording each command and its result as you go; this card changes no file of the repository.

