      :brief "REPO: mas-bandwidth/nova-tools
BASE: sprint/mechanical-2026-10-02
KIND: fix-red
CLASS: model
LEG: go
DEADLINE: finish within 120 minutes
DEPENDS-ON: tdocs-glossary-terminology-lint
PATHS: .github/workflows/docs.yml,Makefile,internal/ci/docs_ci_class_test.go
SHARED: Makefile
TEST: ./internal/ci TestDocsWorkflowRunsTheDocsGatesOnEveryDocsChange
Deadline: finish within 120 minutes.
Libraries considered: the tree's own packages and testify; no new dependency.

ATTRIBUTION. Commits and reports name the friend (By: rowan-space) and your actual model and harness. Never claim a model or harness you are not running. A Claude worker writes the true Claude trailer.

THE TASK. nova-tools v1.2.0, lens docs (Glenn 2026-10-04: the whole documentation treatment; a stranger, human or AI, can use every tool from its docs alone). Docs break quietly unless something runs on every change. Add .github/workflows/docs.yml: on pull requests and pushes touching docs/**, **/README.md, cmd/*/verbhelp.go or tools/clidoc/**, run `make docs-check` (a new Makefile target): the internal/docs tests, `nova-check links --dir .` over the tree, the generated CLI check (card tdocs-cli-generated), the terminology lint (tdocs-glossary-terminology-lint). Each workflow step is one command of a Go tool or make, no shell logic (Glenn's rule: no bash in anything that ships); it runs in under 5 minutes (state the measured time from a bench run). Read .github/workflows/ci.yml for the repo's conventions (Go setup, caching) and follow them. The red test first: internal/ci/docs_ci_class_test.go parses the workflow and the Makefile and fails while a docs gate named above is not run, or a step carries shell control flow. Edit only the files PATHS names; a change that needs another file is a HOLD naming it. Other cards of this batch also edit Makefile (the SHARED line): add your paragraph as its own subsection headed with this card id, under the section it belongs to, and change no other paragraph of it.

STEP 1. Set `JOB=~/rowan-working/jobs/<job>` from BRIEF.md, create only that directory, and clone inside it: `mkdir -p \"$JOB\" && cd \"$JOB\" && git clone -q https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/nova-tools.git repo && cd repo`. Create the exact STATUS branch from the current remote tip of origin/rowan/integration-2026-10-04. Export GOCACHE=~/rowan-working/.cache/go-build GOFLAGS=-mod=readonly NOVA_TEST_NO_HOST=1 before any go command. Read AGENTS.md and the docs named in PATHS first.

STEP 2. Do the task above, writing the red test first on the twin store or with fakes; no test opens a real socket to a shared service or sleeps on the wall clock.
  PATHS: .github/workflows/docs.yml,Makefile,internal/ci/docs_ci_class_test.go
  COMMIT: tdocs-docs-ci: docs CI: the docs gates run on every change that touches docs or help
  VERDICT: a docs workflow runs the docs tests, the link check and the generated-CLI check on every pull request that touches docs/, a README or a verbhelp.go, each step one command of a Go tool, and the class test is red when a docs gate is missing from it.

STEP 3. Run on a Linux bench (vision or hetzner), never on the Studio: `nice -n 10 env GOMAXPROCS=4 go test -p 2 ./internal/ci -run 'TestDocsWorkflowRunsTheDocsGatesOnEveryDocsChange' -count=1 -timeout 600s`, then `nice -n 10 env GOMAXPROCS=4 go test -p 2 -count=1 -timeout 600s ./internal/ci`, record exact last lines, and commit only PATHS with honest attribution; `gofmt -l` on the changed files prints nothing.

STEP 4. END. Push normally with `git push -q origin HEAD:refs/heads/<the STATUS line's branch>`; never force. Verify `git ls-remote origin refs/heads/<that branch>` equals `git rev-parse HEAD`. Write `~/rowan-working/outbox/<job>/REPORT.md` beginning `Verdict: LAND` and `Head: <full 40-hex remote tip>`, followed by one paragraph stating the change and exact gates. Use HOLD or FAIL with the precise blocker when no truthful LAND is possible. Write RESULT.md beside it carrying this card's RESULT line. Create no pull request; the sprint consumes the branch and report.

DONE-WHEN: `go test -count=1 -timeout 600s ./internal/ci -run TestDocsWorkflowRunsTheDocsGatesOnEveryDocsChange` passes at the head.

RULES.
Work only in the job directory this card names.
Never force-push or rebase a shared branch.
Never kill a process you did not start.
Never start a server on this machine.
No `rm -rf` outside the job directory.
Report what was not done.")
